{"Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00A9B9": "「その身を穿つ！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00A9D8": "「地斬疾空刀！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00A9F1": "「地を斬り、空を疾れ！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AA19": "「五大剣には、こういう使い方もある！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AA53": "「受けてもらうぞ……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AA78": "「この攻撃がお前に見切れるか……！？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AAB2": "「音速を超えて斬りこむ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AADD": "「風刃閃！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AAF0": "「攻撃終了……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AB0C": "「行け、ヴァイサーガ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AB31": "「これが、風刃閃だ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AB50": "「風の刃を防げはしない！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AB78": "「これで決まりだ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AB94": "「ヴァイサーガ、フルドライブ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00ABC5": "「限界まで加速する！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00ABE7": "「コード入力、光刃閃」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AC09": "「リミット解除、フルドライブ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AC3A": "「リミット解除、ドッギャーーン！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AC71": "「奥義、光刃閃！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AC90": "「受けろ！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00ACA6": "「これで終わりだ……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00ACCB": "「この斬撃、かわせはしまい！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00ACF9": "「くらえっ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AD0F": "「これが奥義・光刃閃だ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AD34": "「風を……そして、光を超えろ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AD65": "「五大剣、閃光の如く！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AD8D": "「とどめ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00ADA0": "「シーケンス・エンド」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00ADC2": "「五大剣で斬りまくりんぐ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00ADED": "「レッツ・ストライキン！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AE15": "「……何を解除したんだ、私は」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/059.bmd|0x00AE43": "「ロック・オン……！　スプリットミサイル！」", 